<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct rubber imports up 63.5 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct rubber imports up 63.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 410,000 tonnes of natural rubber, including latex, in the first 10 months of the year, up 63.5 percent from the same 1995 period, the Futures Herald quoted customs figures as saying on Monday.</p>
<p>In October, imports of natural rubber, including latex, were 50,000 tonnes, the newspaper said without giving comparative figures.</p>
<p>Imports of synthetic rubber, including latex, in January-October were 287,097 tonnes, up 15.4 percent from the same 1995 period, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Imports in October alone were 30,574 tonnes, it said without giving any comparison.</p>
</text>
